          "id": "india-horizon-europe-association-2026-11-06",
          "headline": "India and EU finish talks for India to join the €93.5bn Horizon Europe research fund",
          "summary": "India and the European Union have concluded negotiations on India's association with Horizon Europe, the EU's €93.5 billion research and innovation programme, the European Commission announced. Indian researchers, firms and labs will be able to get EU grants directly and lead joint projects in areas such as health, AI, digital, space, climate and energy. The deal still has to be signed and ratified; it is meant to take effect in January 2027.",
